+before doing any review work. They match the assignment exactly.
+
+## Frozen replay modes
+
+Verdict: CONFIRMED.
+
+I ran the frozen `block_descent_a1_genus_ladder_c34_c40_s4_replay.py`
+directly from the lane input directory with `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`.
